#X text 30 20 There are 3 colors: background \, flash color (when a message arrives) and foreground (text) color. By default it uses the Pd colors (where the Pd select color is used for flashing color). You can change that via properties or the creation flag and apply the user set colors instead. When flashing \, the text color chooses either white or black as a contrast color. As already mentioned \, you can also set the object not to flash.;
